    },
    {
      "key": "n4a2be09b5349",
      "text": "足るを知る者は富む、君のスキで心満ちる。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "ココア",
      "handle": "open_bison5447",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:08+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/open_bison5447/n/n4a2be09b5349"
    },
    {
      "key": "na34583dba40e",
      "text": "プレゼントをつけあの場所に。物語は続く。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "ふつうのひとU",
      "handle": "rosy_pika19",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "シロクマ文芸部20字小説　記憶",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:08+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/rosy_pika19/n/na34583dba40e"
    },
    {
      "key": "n5150115a82ca",
      "text": "「こう来るか、人生」 吐きすて、顔を上ぐ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "とらふぐ子",
      "handle": "yumenoatosaki25",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "青空",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:09+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/yumenoatosaki25/n/n5150115a82ca",
      "sourceLines": [
        "「こう来るか、人生」",
        "吐きすて、顔を上ぐ。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "n868dccc5943f",
      "text": "「性根がマカロンだよね⭐︎」それ褒めてる？",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "とき子",
      "handle": "toccodocco",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "あるいはフレネミー［20字小説］",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:09+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/toccodocco/n/n868dccc5943f"
    },
    {
      "key": "nb6aec06cda10",
      "text": "ドアが開き、スマホが転がり線路に消えた。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "秋音（アキネ）",
      "handle": "shiny_squid3060",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "夜の駅",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:09+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/shiny_squid3060/n/nb6aec06cda10"
    },
    {
      "key": "n3c9b233d5406",
      "text": "「おばちゃんより」って書くの、初めてだ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "虹風　想蒔",
      "handle": "i_nw_ao_rbdmges",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "バースデーカード　#20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:10+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/i_nw_ao_rbdmges/n/n3c9b233d5406"
    },
    {
      "key": "n365b9e2cb49c",
      "text": "私は鏡の前で詫びをした。錆びついた心に。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "るび",
      "handle": "rubi_1x36",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "心機一転　#20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:11+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/rubi_1x36/n/n365b9e2cb49c"
    },
    {
      "key": "naab424f67559",
      "text": "トルティーヤが好きだなんて、聞いてない。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "下里　彩",
      "handle": "nisemono24",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】高3男子",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:11+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/nisemono24/n/naab424f67559"
    },
    {
      "key": "nd9ca2488a403",
      "text": "「ワッ」に振り向くと、「バカじゃない」。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "秋音（アキネ）",
      "handle": "shiny_squid3060",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "理不尽",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:14+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/shiny_squid3060/n/nd9ca2488a403"
    },
    {
      "key": "n4fc89fb66f4c",
      "text": "昼は教師、夜は泥棒。今の雇用主は小学生。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "増長　晃　📚🍃＠現代ファンタジー",
      "handle": "akira_masunaga",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】この町のコンビ",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:15+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/akira_masunaga/n/n4fc89fb66f4c"
    },
    {
      "key": "n104eb0a29419",
      "text": "本当の私は、最大瞬間風速の夜風に紛れてく",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "アージ | arji",
      "handle": "sun_pulan",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "最大瞬間風速　｜20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:17+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/sun_pulan/n/n104eb0a29419"
    },
    {
      "key": "n5ff4ca4942f8",
      "text": "足を速めるが追い越せず、怪しい影となる。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "翠川 緑（Ryoku Suikawa）",
      "handle": "ryoku_suikawa",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説 『夜道でふたり』 シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:18+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/ryoku_suikawa/n/n5ff4ca4942f8"
    },
    {
      "key": "nb772065d6fbe",
      "text": "「また明日ね。」と言える幸せに気付いた。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "miri",
      "handle": "mirinoippuku",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "小説なんて書いたことない人",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:19+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/mirinoippuku/n/nb772065d6fbe"
    },
    {
      "key": "n3f2808b10885",
      "text": "黄昏に雨を駆けた。不意の泥水がももまで。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "有馬とお",
      "handle": "arimaroku",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説| 黄昏の水たまり",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:31+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/arimaroku/n/n3f2808b10885"
    },
    {
      "key": "n889240c85dc6",
      "text": "見開かれた瞳に思わず微笑み返す久しぶり！",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "kantan.",
      "handle": "kantannara",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "不意打ちで｜20字小説シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:31+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/kantannara/n/n889240c85dc6"
    },
    {
      "key": "ne034ed522cc3",
      "text": "消えない傷あと。こころと家具、追憶の君。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "Yoshi",
      "handle": "roquetter",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "#20字小説｜傷",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:35+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/roquetter/n/ne034ed522cc3"
    },
    {
      "key": "n3cdab6ab9038",
      "text": "毎年同じ風景。毎年変わる、あの子の背丈。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "落第人間うさ太郎",
      "handle": "mudamuda_muda",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "『成長』　/20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:36+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/mudamuda_muda/n/n3cdab6ab9038"
    },
    {
      "key": "na8ef032f109d",
      "text": "薄らぐ誕生日。祝うのは誰？おめでとう私。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "玉三郎",
      "handle": "tama3ro",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "自画自祝  #20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:40+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/tama3ro/n/na8ef032f109d"
    },
    {
      "key": "n3c57b3b6d8b1",
      "text": "全員集合！って20字でなくて20時だろ？",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "中之人成",
      "handle": "akashiba555",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説　「勘違い」　#シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:42+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/akashiba555/n/n3c57b3b6d8b1"
    },
    {
      "key": "nd99975e5c8d2",
      "text": "ベッドの上は私の城で、私は寝巻きの王様。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "うえお",
      "handle": "aiueo_3",
      "creditGroup": "club",
