      "title": "寝巻きの王様 | 20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:49+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/aiueo_3/n/nd99975e5c8d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "n616474c1bc33",
      "text": "NYの女神に「おはよ」と呟く君、20時。",
