      "url": "https://note.com/ganbarusyufuyade/n/n26132648efb2"
    },
    {
      "key": "n111fd075db95",
      "text": "息で稜線が霞む。陵に赤い点、跳ねる鼓動。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "中之人成",
      "handle": "akashiba555",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説　「灯」　#シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:00:56+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/akashiba555/n/n111fd075db95"
    },
    {
      "key": "n23b978759193",
      "text": "帰ると言った彼の上着に、私は袖を通した。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "片隅",
      "handle": "yazawa_kentaro",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "ろうらく｜20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:01:00+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/yazawa_kentaro/n/n23b978759193"
    },
    {
      "key": "ndf29117120bf",
      "text": "迷い猫とは失礼な人間たちを飼ってるだけ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "トモ。",
      "handle": "tomo_with_ai",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "迷い猫の20字",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:01:00+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/tomo_with_ai/n/ndf29117120bf"
    },
    {
      "key": "n676d2f46daf5",
      "text": "月を拾ったら、六畳間にも潮が満ちてきた。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "tomo",
      "handle": "tomo5562",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "六畳の満潮　#20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:01:02+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/tomo5562/n/n676d2f46daf5"
    },
    {
      "key": "n219bd0ccd6c9",
      "text": "滑り込みセ〜フ！ あれ？落とし紙… アウト！",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "中之人成",
      "handle": "akashiba555",
