      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:04:53+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/hearty_phlox231/n/n33ec80acd0fa"
    },
    {
      "key": "nad6e44cec6f8",
      "text": "十月の歌集、割れても末に逢はむとぞ思ふ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "結月",
      "handle": "yuzuki60st",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "栞と十月の歌集",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:05:16+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/yuzuki60st/n/nad6e44cec6f8"
    },
    {
      "key": "n05e1810e509c",
      "text": "まだ鳴くかコオロギ。どこよ？オレの彼女。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "安＆堵",
      "handle": "great_zephyr4402",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説「晩秋」 シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:06:26+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/great_zephyr4402/n/n05e1810e509c"
    },
    {
      "key": "n60501ffdae8a",
      "text": "달이 예쁘다. …라면 먹고 갈래요？」",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "キフユリミ(chwi_bomb2522)",
      "handle": "grand_macaw5480",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】「추워요. 야,",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:06:31+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/grand_macaw5480/n/n60501ffdae8a"
    },
    {
      "key": "nf9ee09ab9334",
      "text": "甘美な嘘とエグ味の本当。どっちが欲しい？",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "水生ミヲ",
      "handle": "mio_mizuki",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "いっぽんでもにんじん、みたいな ｜ 20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:06:40+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/mio_mizuki/n/nf9ee09ab9334"
    },
    {
      "key": "n6c22da50fe81",
      "text": "若葉の光に目を細め、坂道を駆け出した。",
      "charCount": 19,
      "authorName": "認識のミステリ",
      "handle": "shift_view",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "#20字小説｜シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T20:07:47+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/shift_view/n/n6c22da50fe81"
    },
    {
      "key": "n38bbffa2895e",
      "text": "人生の続きを、あなたと同じページに書く。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "名古屋プレ花2027.03.06の夫",
      "handle": "sane_gnu4460",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
